#: index.php:111
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versija"

#: index.php:144 index.php:286
msgid "Create bootable USB drives the easy way"
msgstr "Viegls veids kā izveidot OS ielādes USB ierīci"

#: index.php:230
msgid "Change language:"
msgstr "Mainīt valodu:"

#: index.php:239
msgid "Want to improve this translation?"
msgstr "Vēlaties uzlabot šo tulkojumu?"

#: index.php:313
msgid ""
"Rufus is a utility that helps format and create bootable USB flash drives, "
"such as USB keys/pendrives, memory sticks, etc."
msgstr ""
"<b>Rufus</b> ir instruments ar kura palīdzību var formatēt un izveidot "
"operētājsistēmas ielādes ierīci uz tādiem nesējiem, kā USB pieslēguma "
"zibatmiņas, atmiņas kartes u.c."

#: index.php:314
msgid "It can be especially useful for cases where:"
msgstr "To var izmantot šādos gadījumos:"

#: index.php:316
msgid ""
"you need to create USB installation media from bootable ISOs (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"jums nepieciešams izveidot USB instalācijas nesēju no ISO formāta (Windows, "
"Linux, UEFI, u.c.)"

#: index.php:317
msgid "you need to work on a system that doesn't have an OS installed"
msgstr "jums nepieciešams strādāt ar datoru uz kura nav instalēta OS"

#: index.php:318
msgid "you need to flash a BIOS or other firmware from DOS"
msgstr "jums jāpārprogrammē BIOS vai jebkādu citu mikroprogrammu no DOS"

#: index.php:319
msgid "you want to run a low-level utility"
msgstr "jums jāpiestartē zema līmeņa OS programma"

#: index.php:321
msgid "Despite its small size, Rufus provides everything you need!"
msgstr ""
"Neskatoties uz mazo apjomu, <b>Rufus</b> nodrošina jums visu nepieciešamo!"

#: index.php:322
msgid ""
"A non exhaustive list of Rufus supported ISOs is also provided at the bottom"
" of this page."
msgstr ""
"Daļējs ISO atbalstāmo formātu saraksts, ar kuriem strādā <b>Rufus</b>, ir "
"uzrādīts lapas apakšā."

