#: index.php:379
msgid "Windows 8 or later."
msgstr "Windows 8 vai jaunāka versija."

#: index.php:379
msgid "Once downloaded, the application is ready to use."
msgstr "Uzreiz pēc lejupielādes <b>Rufus</b> ir gatavs lietošanai."

#: index.php:380
msgid "Supported Languages:"
msgstr "Atbalstītās valodas:"

#: index.php:426
msgid ""
"I will take this opportunity to express my gratitude to the translators who "
"made it possible for Rufus, as well as this webpage, to be translated in "
"various languages. If you find that you can use Rufus in your own language, "
"you should really thank them!"
msgstr ""
"Izmantojot iespēju, gribu izteikt pateicību tiem, kas programmu <b>Rufus</b>"
" un šo mājaslapu ir tulkojuši vairākās valodās. Ja jūs ievērojāt, ka varat "
"<b>Rufus</b> izmantot savā dzimtajā valodā, jāizsaka pateicība tieši viņiem!"

#: index.php:277 index.php:429
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Izmantošana"

#: index.php:430
msgid ""
"Download the executable and run it &ndash; no installation is necessary."
msgstr ""
"Lejuplādējiet failu un palaidiet to &ndash; instalācija nav nepieciešama."

#: index.php:431
msgid "The executable is digitally signed and the signature should state:"
msgstr "Palaišanas fails ir elektroniski parakstīts, kurš satur:"

#: index.php:433
msgid "(v1.3.0 or later)"
msgstr "(v1.3.0 vai jaunāka)"

#: index.php:434
msgid "(v1.2.0 or earlier)"
msgstr "(v1.2.0 vai vecāka)"

#: index.php:436
msgid "Notes on DOS support:"
msgstr "Piezīmes DOS atbalstam:"

#: index.php:437
msgid ""
"If you create a DOS bootable drive and use a non-US keyboard, Rufus will "
"attempt to select a keyboard layout according to the locale of your system."
msgstr ""
"Ja veidojat DOS ielādes disku un neizmantojat US tastatūras izkārtojumu, "
"<b>Rufus</b> izvēlēsies izkārtojumu no jūsu OS reģinālajiem uzstādījumiem."

#: index.php:438
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Piezīmes ISO atbalstam:"

#: index.php:439
#, php-format
msgid ""
"All versions of Rufus since v1.1.0 allow the creation of a bootable USB from"
" an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Sākot no versijas 1.1.0, <b>Rufus</b> ļauj izveidot OS ielādes disku no <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO formāta</a> failiem (faili ar paplašinājumu .iso)."

#: index.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a CD burning application, such as the"
" freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> or <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."
msgstr ""
"Izveidot ISO bildi no fiziska diskai vai failu kopas ir viegli darāms, "
"toties jums būs jāizmanto kāda no brīvi pieejamām (<i>Freeware</i>) "
"programmām - <a target=\"_blank\" %s>InfraRecorder</a> vai <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

#: index.php:443
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)"
msgstr "Bieži uzdotie jautājumi (BUJ)"

#. You are encouraged to add the translation for " (in English)." after
#. "HERE</a></b>" as the FAQ is only available in English
#: index.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "A Rufus FAQ is available <b><a target=\"_blank\" %s>HERE</a></b>."
msgstr ""
"Saistītie BUJ ar <b>Rufus</b> atrodas <b><a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>ŠEIT</a></b> (angliski)."

#: index.php:445
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To provide feedback, report a bug or request an enhancement, please use the "
"GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>issue tracker</a>. Or you can <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>send an e-mail</a>."
msgstr ""
"Lai atstātu atsauksmi, paziņot par kļūdu vai ieteikt kādu padomu, "
"izmantojiet GitHub <a target=\"_blank\" %s>problēmu novēršana</a>. Tāpat jūs"
" varat sazināties <a target=\"_blank\" %s>sūtot e-pastu</a>."

#: index.php:448
msgid "License"
msgstr "Licence"

#: index.php:449
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) version 3</a> or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"<a target=\"_blank\" %s>GNU General Public License (GPL) versija 3</a> vai "
"jaunāka."

#: index.php:449
msgid ""
"You are free to distribute, modify or even sell the software, insofar as you"
" respect the GPLv3 license."
msgstr ""
"Jūs varat brīvi izplatīt, mainīt, vai pat pārdot <b>Rufus</b> "
"programmnodrošinājumu ievērojot GPLv3 nosacījumus un noteikumus."

#: index.php:450
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus is produced in a 100%% transparent manner, from its <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>public source</a>, using a <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>MinGW32</a> environment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Rufus</b> ir izveidota izmantojot 100%% <a target=\"_blank\" %s>atvērtu "
"kodu</a>, izmantojot <a target=\"_blank\" %s>MinGW32</a> vidi."

#. You are encouraged to append the translation for "(in English)" after
#. "Changelog" as it is only available in English
#: index.php:453
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "Izmaiņas (angliski)"

#: index.php:279 index.php:485
msgid "Source Code"
msgstr "Pirmkods"

#: index.php:487
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can clone the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repository "
"using:"
msgstr ""
"Jūs varat veidot <a target=\"_blank\" %s>git</a> repozitorijas klonu "
"izmantojot:"

#: index.php:489
#, php-format
msgid "For more information, see the <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."
msgstr "Papildinformācijai skatieties <a target=\"_blank\" %s>GitHub project</a>."

#: index.php:490
msgid ""
"If you are a developer, you are very much encouraged to tinker with Rufus "
"and submit patches."
msgstr ""
"Ja esat izstrādātājs, jūs varat palīdzēt projektam atsūtot savus "
"<b>Rufus</b> labojumus, papildinājumus, u.c."

#: index.php:280 index.php:493
msgid "Donations"
msgstr "Ziedojumi"

#: index.php:494
msgid ""
"Since I'm getting asked about this on regular basis, there is <b>no</b> "
"donation button on this page."
msgstr ""
"Bieži saņemu jautājumu, kāpēc <b>Rufus</b> mājaslapā <b>nav</b> ziedojumu "
"linka."

#: index.php:495
msgid ""
"The main reason is that I feel that the donation system doesn't actually "
"help software development and worse, can be guilt-inducing for users who "
"choose not to donate."
msgstr ""
"Ziedojumu linka neesamība ir saistīta ar to, ka pēc maniem ieskatiem "
"ziedojumi nekādā ziņā nepalīdz programmnodrošinājuma izstrādē un attīstībā, "
"bet tikai rada vainas apziņu tiem lietotājiem, kuri jebkādu iemeslu dēļ nav "
"ziedojuši konkrētam projektam."

#: index.php:498
#, php-format
msgid ""
"If you really insist, you can always make a donation to the <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, as they are the main "
"reason software like Rufus is possible."
msgstr ""
"Ja jūs tiešām uzskatāt ka materiāls atbalsts ir nepieciešams, tad varat "
"veikt zidojumus <a target=\"_blank\" %s>Free Software Foundation</a>, jo "
"tieši pateicoties FSF ir iespējams programmu <b>Rufus</b> attīstīt."

#: index.php:499
msgid ""
"At any rate, I'll take this opportunity to say <i><u>thank you</u></i> for "
"your continuing support and enthusiasm about this little program: it is much"
" appreciated!"
msgstr ""
"Jebkurā gadījumā, es vēlos jums izteikt <i><u>pateicību</i></u> par jūsu "
"atbalstu un entuziasmu, kuri saistīti ar programmu <b>Rufus</b>. Man tas ir "
"ļoti svarīgi!"

#: index.php:500
msgid ""
"But please continue to feel free to use Rufus without any guilt about not "
"contributing for it financially &ndash; you should never have to!"
msgstr ""
"Turpiniet rīkoties ar šo programmnodrošinājumu neuztraucoties par "
"ziedojumiem."

#: index.php:503
msgid "Non exhaustive list of ISOs Rufus is known to work with"
msgstr ""
"Nepilnīgs ISO atbalstāmo formātu saraksts ar kādiem strādā programma "
"<b>Rufus</b>"

